Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是一支与众不同的军队…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are an army unlike any other...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在星际之间遨游 向他们的受允之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crusading across the stars toward a place called UnderVerse,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗星际前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their promised land...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个黑暗笼罩的新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a constellation of dark new worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们被称作死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Necromongers, they're called.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不归顺他们 就会被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if they can not convert you, they will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领导他们的就是马歇尔王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leading them, the Lord Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他独自到星际之门朝圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He alone has made a pilgrimage to the gates of the UnderVerse...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来时完全变了样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and returned a different being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得更强大 更陌生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stronger. Stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一半是人 另一半是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half alive and half...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.47,0:02:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们想要生存 就必须找到新的平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are to survive, a new balance must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般情况 正义总能战胜邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In normal times, evil would be fought by good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in times like these, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要另一种邪恶来制止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it should be fought by another kind of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《星际传奇2》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(UV星系 6号星球)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逃 稳住 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linin' him up for you. Port-side shot comin' up. Steady. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 托姆斯 没路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Toombs, we're runnin' out of road!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我知道 再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! I got it! Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托姆斯 我不清楚 看上去太窄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Toombs. Looks kind of tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不管 这可是报酬最高的一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not where I'm sittin'. This is the biggest payday ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别磨蹭了 快点进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So throw on a fresh pair of panties. Let's get this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷3米 右舷1.5米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three meters clearance port-side. One and a half meters starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心隘口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a choke point comin'up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的 这到底是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the shit was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰格斯 你看见瑞迪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tags, you got eyes on Riddick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰格斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tags?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一下子干了两个人 而我都还没看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just ghosted two guys, and I never even saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托姆斯 你认为怎样好？也许 我们应该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Toombs? I mean, maybe we ought to just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想现在你是我的新枪手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're my new gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿上枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab a Gat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次在他上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on top of him this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你犯了三个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made three mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一 你接了这个活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you took the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二 你来得太轻率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second, you came light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支四个人的队伍来抓我？太小看我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A four-man crew for me? Fuckin' insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你犯的最严重的错误是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the worst mistake you made...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空弹匣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empty gun rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的头现在值多少？- 一百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the bounty on my head?  - One mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一百五十万  - 谁付你这一百五十万？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One-point-five.  - What slam pays 1.5 for a convict?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个秘密组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Private party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 朋友 别紧张 没有姓名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, hey! Guy, guy! Easy! Anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 单子上是这样写的  - 哪个星球？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what the sheet said.  - What planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希里奥·帕莱姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helion Prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 你要去哪 赏金猎人？最后一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. Where you goin'? Last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好好好回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you better get this one right, merc.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这艘飞船是谁的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose ship is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是为我而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knew they'd come for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们花了五年时间 但是我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took'em five years, but I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能指望这些赏金猎人 有尊严 有原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't expect these mercs to have any honor, any code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这次的悬赏来自一位圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this new bounty from a holy man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个我曾经救过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a guy whose neck I saved...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 学到一课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, lesson learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有"朋友"这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No such word as "friend."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让别人接近自己太近 总没好下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can only end bad when you let someone get too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他们不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在是回到所有光明的 一切我憎恨的那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now it's back to all the brightness... and everything I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知她会否在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonder if she'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(火成星系 烈焰星)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你像只动物 我要把你关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Act like an animal and I'm gonna slot you up like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙总是惹麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one is always in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我闻出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it! I smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:09:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we shut the goddamn noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在低温休眠状态下人脑是停止活动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say most of your brain shuts down in cryosleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低温休眠下大脑是停止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brain shuts down in cryosleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 除了原始的一面  - 除了原始的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All but the primitive side.  - All but the primitive side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动物的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The animal side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇星人的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All but the Furyan side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们中的一些人还记得 曾经发生在复仇星上的罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us still remember the true crime that happened here on Furya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你一旦醒来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once you wake...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正醒来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}truly wake...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll remember too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕莱姆警戒等级4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helion Prime is on alert condition four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未识别飞船 请跟我到六号发射台接受安全检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unrecognized craft. You need to follow me to Spaceport Six for security inspections.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 听到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立即跟我到六号发射台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me to Spaceport Six now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(希里奥星系 希里奥 帕莱姆星)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊曼 为我们祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imam, pray for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认了 是的 两季后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was confirmed two seasons back. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就要来了 我们是下一个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming here. I mean, are we next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要开战了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Militants storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 到那时躲到地下掩体里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But going to the underground shelters if it happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的对 我也这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. That's what I thought too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备留下还是离开？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you staying or leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都结束了 都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the end of everything. Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我的邻居… 半条街都空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my neighbors... Half my street is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？我不知道 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do? I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们叫他们 魔鬼胡德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hood of the devil. That's what someone called 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们？他们是谁？新人种？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Them? Who is them? Some kind of new creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说八道 全是废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nonsense. It's all nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们高得可以触到云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tall that it touches the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雕像周围一点东西都没有 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's nothing around this statue, this colossus. Nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他们的标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their calling card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知不知道所有的门都锁上了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know all your doors were locked?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从那个星球带走了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took two people off that planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个孩子 杰克 谁都认为是个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kid, Jack, who everyone else thought was a boy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一位圣人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a holy man...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寻找新麦加的圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}searching for New Mecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的妻子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉了一个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told one man...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I might go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把信任给了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I showed trust to one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊曼 我是不是错了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I make a mistake, Imam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案不是那么简单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no simple answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有说过的话 都是为了给我们一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever was said was meant to give us a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个战斗的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是有侵略的威胁 我永远不会背叛你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were it not for the threat of invasion, I never would have betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证 瑞迪 瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you my word, Riddick. Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个女儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 她的名字是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No!  - Whose name would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你对我有意见 找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have issue with me, you let it be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不需要知道她们的名字  - 西扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need not know their names.  - Ziza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字是西扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Ziza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ziza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可爱的孩子  - 你真的杀过怪物吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cute kid.  - Did you really kill monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些想杀害我父亲的怪物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones that were gonna hurt my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是她晚上睡觉前听的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such are our bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 西扎 睡觉去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Ziza. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀了谁才能摘掉挂在我头上的悬赏？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now who do I have to kill to get this payday off my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说慧星过后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is said the comet always precedes them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是世界末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these world-enders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些煤袋区域的行星都不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Coal sack planets are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,800万居民失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight million settlers missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个天鹰座也消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire Aquiline System is gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.61,0:14:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希里奥 帕莱姆和附近的其他星球分享阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helicon Prime shares its sunlight with all worlds nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们完了 他们也完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we fall, they fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪 我怎么救我的家人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, how do I save my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到我说的了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard anything I've said?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说整个宇宙都将毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it's all circling the drain... the whole universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对吗？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right?  - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终有一日要终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to end sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的人现在就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one you want is now here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谁的咽喉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whose throat is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你割了我的喉咙 我就没有办法废除你的悬赏令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you cut my throat, I'll not be able to rescind the offer that brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能告诉你为什么非要你到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor tell you why it's so vital that you did come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬赏取消 刀子才会拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blade comes off when the bounty comes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是艾尔伦 来自元素族的使节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Aereon, an envoy from the Elemental race.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她对你没有恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She means you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有几个人能在死亡使者 手底下逃生还能泄露他们的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are very few of us who have met a Necromonger and lived to speak of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我既然选择开口 你就应该听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when I choose to speak of it, you should choose to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Necromonger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的名字就是顺我者昌 逆我者亡 直到最后一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the name that will convert or kill every last human life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非宇宙能重拾平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless the universe can rebalance itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你该假装在谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should pretend like you're talkin' to someone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.09,0:16:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如和一位有教养的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}educated in the penal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 用不着假装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, don't pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平衡是所有元素的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balance is everything to elementals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水之于火 泥土之于空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water to fire. Earth to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有33对不同的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 33 different words for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们只有时间来谈谈平衡的 两个对立面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now we have only time to speak of the balance of opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个传说 瑞迪 关于年轻的复仇星人男性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a story, Riddick, of young male Furyans...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出生时被绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}strangled at birth...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他们自己的脐带绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}strangled with their own cords.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当艾尔伦把这个故事告诉希里奥首领的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Aereon told this story to the Helion leaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对她提到了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对你童年时候的事情知道多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know of your early years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得你的家乡吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember your home world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 你遇到过其他同类吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where it was?  - Have you met any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你一样的同类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个就够他们受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister, they don't know what to do with just one of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 退后  - 开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand back!  - Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们在搜查  - 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They are searching houses!  - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在找一个今天到这里的男人 说他可能是个间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look for a man who came here today. They think he might be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 间谍？- 有人今天看见他来这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A spy?  - Did someone see him come here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有吗？- 纳姜 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did they?  - Lajjun, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们确信他就在这里  - 我会把他们打发走 请等一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're sure he's in there!  - I will send them away. But wait one minute, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了拯救世界 能再等一会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you wait one minute to save worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你打算弃我们于不顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you will leave us to our fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就象你弃她于不顾一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like you did her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们把他们打发走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Let us try to send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 快点  - 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move it. Come on.  - Leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不明白 他能帮助我们 他能帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. He can help us! He can help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不害怕黑暗 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid of the dark, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抓住他  - 他在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him!  - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你提到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mentioned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She went looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人死了 她被关进了监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People died. She went to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我不记得在哪里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I don't remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那个地方很热 在地面根本无法存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was a world so hot you not survive on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烈焰星 小杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crematoria. Young Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她把你当作她的大哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thought of you as her older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她崇拜你  - 你要好好照看好她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She worshipped you.  - You were supposed to watch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她永远都不会原谅你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never forgive you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在她最需要你的时候离开她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for leaving just when she needed you most.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该离我远点 你们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needed to stay away from me. You all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会阻止新的怪兽吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna stop the new monsters now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇星人 永不低头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furyans. Defiant to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去庇护所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就我们自己去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take only ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.37,0:22:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠紧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.31,0:23:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指挥官们 让所有小队马上起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight leaders, get all squads off the ground now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have heavy inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.30,0:24:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个庇护所 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next shelter. This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.12,0:24:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.05,0:24:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看是否安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see if it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 退后  - 来吧 西扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay back!  - Come, Ziza.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.21,0:25:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟着我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.93,0:26:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纳姜 西扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lajjun and Ziza!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.33,0:26:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等结束再走  - 让我走 我必须找到我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When it's over.  - Let me go. I must get to my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我借了条船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I borrowed a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.80,0:26:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以一起上船 如果你不介意我是个犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can ride along, if you don't mind riding with a convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 但是得先把家人送到对岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank you, but I must get my family across the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:26:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运气好的话能帮他们找到一个庇护所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God willing, there is still a shelter I can get them...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.12,0:27:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝自有安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure God has his tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.26,0:27:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但若说谁能逃离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but getting out of places no one else can,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.97,0:27:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那非我莫属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.29,0:27:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去接你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.12,0:27:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.80,0:29:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伊曼  - 别跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Imam!  - Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.65,0:30:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会有来世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be an afterlife for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.70,0:30:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will there be for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去补充一下兵员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go replenish the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王朝的灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never fails to inspire, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.02,0:32:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远都会给你灵感 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each time a dynasty falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你的位置 瓦寇夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember your place, Dame Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的位置就在你旁边 亲爱的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My place is at your side, dear husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.00,0:32:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里直到暗黑星际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here till UnderVerse come.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.06,0:32:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this 'verse,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.03,0:33:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命是和自然状态站在对立面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}life is antagonistic to the natural state.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 有不同种族的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, humans in all their various races...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.68,0:33:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争不断的爆发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are a spontaneous outbreak...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是无法控制的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an unguided mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.53,0:33:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是要纠正这个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to correct that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.21,0:33:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为还有另一个宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there is another 'verse...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.56,0:33:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里生命受到接纳和珍惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a 'verse where life is welcomed and cherished.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.64,0:33:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷人 常新 那儿就是暗黑星际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ravishing, ever-newplace called UnderVerse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.65,0:33:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是通往星际之路…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the road to that 'verse...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.61,0:33:42.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要穿过星际之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crosses over the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.67,0:33:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星际之门 带我们去星际之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Threshold! Take us to the threshold!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.46,0:33:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们称之为… 死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you call... death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.64,0:33:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以在这个星球 生命必须净化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it is this 'verse that must be cleansed of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.65,0:33:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样暗黑星际才能繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that UnderVerse can populate and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.43,0:34:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你们周围 大厅里的每位死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around you. Every Necromonger in this hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.98,0:34:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一夜之间摧毁了你们防线的兵团里的每位死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every one of the Legion Vast that just swept aside your defenses in one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:13.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾和你们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was once like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一样脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fought as feebly as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.21,0:34:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的每一位死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Necromonger that lives today...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.20,0:34:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是皈依者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a convert.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.30,0:34:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不会改变信仰  - 我们都得到了新生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There'll be no conversions!  - We all began as something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.68,0:34:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我第一次听到的时候 也很难接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was hard for me to accept, too, when I first heard these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.37,0:34:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.00,0:34:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让他们带走了我的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let them take away my pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.72,0:34:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你背叛了自己的信仰  - 当你意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You betrayed your faith!  - Just as you will change...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有接受死亡使者命运的人 才能通过星际之门时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you realize that the threshold to the UnderVerse will be crossed...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only by those who have embraced the Necromonger faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.38,0:34:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时你们会立刻跪下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For those of you who will right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.49,0:35:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要求净化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drop to your knees and ask to be purified.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.85,0:35:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不会背弃信仰  - 这里的所有人都不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We will not renounce our faith!  - No one here will do what you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.58,0:35:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不可想像的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is unthinkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个多种族 多信仰的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a world of many peoples, many religions!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.21,0:35:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能 也不会改变自己的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we simply cannot and will not be converted!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就拿走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.30,0:35:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join him...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.96,0:35:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是加入我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.06,0:35:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从马歇尔王的命令跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the Lord Marshal's offer and bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不向任何人下跪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bow to no man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.30,0:36:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.33,0:36:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是见到过暗黑星际的半神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the holy Half-Dead who has seen the UnderVerse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.02,0:36:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我和这里的任何人没有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not with everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.58,0:36:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我有事情要跟他了结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will take a piece of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.48,0:36:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A piece you will have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.46,0:37:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.32,0:37:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊尔根 我最强的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irgun. One of my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.09,0:37:20.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.50,0:37:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得这把刀怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of this blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.06,0:37:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面重了半克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a half-gram heavy on the back end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按我们的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.73,0:37:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以保留你的战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you keep what you kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you familiar to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.46,0:37:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在某个遥远的地方见过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we met on some distant field?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.84,0:38:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd think I'd remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.77,0:38:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我也记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd think I would too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.82,0:38:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他见死亡修罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him before the Quasi-Deads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.34,0:38:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这个种畜会去的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the breeder would do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.09,0:38:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你邀请他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if somebody just asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.18,0:38:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是难得的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a rare offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.86,0:38:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A visit inside Necropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.90,0:38:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久没闻到这么美妙的味道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time since I smelled beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.90,0:38:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.76,0:39:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.12,0:39:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.86,0:39:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六任马歇尔王称这里为家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last six Lord Marshals have called this home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很壮观 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.47,0:39:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我以前见到的不一样 我们都是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might have gone a different way. True of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.68,0:39:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皈依者在接受死亡使者的标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Converts receiving the mark of the Necromonger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.20,0:40:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道一种痛苦如何减轻另一种痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They learn how one pain can lessen another.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.97,0:40:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.14,0:40:24.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个简直… 太完美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is just... perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.26,0:40:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你越抗拒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more you resist them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.64,0:40:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造成的伤害就越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the greater the damage will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.82,0:40:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个新来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.92,0:40:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我们带来了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've brought us the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.08,0:40:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的种畜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting breeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.46,0:41:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会太久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入大脑皮层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've entered his neocortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.32,0:41:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 瑞迪  - 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ahh! The Riddick!  - Regress.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.26,0:41:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫描最新记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning fresh memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.94,0:41:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个叫做杰克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thoughts of someone called Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.40,0:41:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.95,0:41:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她进了监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She went to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.20,0:41:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现一个元素族的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we find thoughts of an Elemental.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.68,0:41:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以阻挡死亡使者的种族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one race that would slow the spread of Necromongers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.53,0:41:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 复仇星人  - 复仇星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Furyans.  - Furyans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.00,0:41:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从那里来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.06,0:42:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么人？我想知道的是这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are his people? These are the things I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.94,0:42:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现了能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须解决你的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must settle your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现了复仇星人的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find Furyan energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.99,0:42:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为了我们大家  - 他是复仇星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For all of us.  - He's Furyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.88,0:42:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.56,0:42:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇星人幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Furyan survivor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.17,0:42:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们的星球 看看三十年前未能逃脱的人们的坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at our world, at the graves of those who didn't escape 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.69,0:42:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非能解决过去的事情 否则我们没有将来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no future until we settle our past...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.36,0:42:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了所有打着印记的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all of us who bear the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.22,0:42:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了复仇星人 杀了瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the Furyan! Kill the Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.05,0:42:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了瑞迪 杀了瑞迪 杀了瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the Riddick! Kill the Riddick! Kill the Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.13,0:42:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀了瑞迪  - 杀了瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill the Riddick!  - Kill the Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.76,0:43:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个男人是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.36,0:43:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到他 无论如何 找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find him. Whatever it takes. Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.33,0:44:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 这次是五个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. A five-man crew this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.76,0:44:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事情你可以做得更好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of things you could have done better.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.73,0:44:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 应该毁掉我飞船上藏着的追踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, trash the locator beacon inside my ship... the one you jacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二 也是非常重要的一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And second... and this is really the more important part...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.56,0:44:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你有机会的时候 应该杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dust my dick when you get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.21,0:44:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有什么问题吗？- 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any questions?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.77,0:44:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么耽误了你这么长时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.52,0:44:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 大个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.36,0:45:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去出来 神不知鬼不觉 干得真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In and out, unsuspected and undetected. Damn, I love a good smash-and-grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.34,0:45:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么快 别这么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast. Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.65,0:45:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 我们被发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dickheads. We're pickin' up fields here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.00,0:45:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船体被未知场发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unknown fields detected on hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.06,0:45:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道  来了  - 这是某种扫描场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I knew it. Here it comes.  - This is some kind of scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.73,0:45:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 可能是探测到我们的热量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Readin' our Btus, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.00,0:45:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发射伪装船  - 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's drop one.  - Dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.86,0:45:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伪装船发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decoy launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.61,0:45:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备离子驱动  - 那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Preparing to engage ion drive.  - So,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.02,0:45:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到哪把你丢下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where do we drop your merc-killin' ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.89,0:45:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁为你付赏金呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna pay the most for you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.62,0:45:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 屠夫湾  - 屠夫湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Butcher Bay?  - Butcher Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.27,0:45:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每隔一天十分钟的放风时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes every other day on the dog run.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.57,0:45:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里的蛋白质饼不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protein waffles aren't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.86,0:46:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 小熊星座怎么样？不错的小型双重戒备监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how 'bout Ursa Luna? Nice little double-max prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.52,0:46:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一直为我保留了一间 就等着我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They keep a cell open for me... just in case I drop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.77,0:46:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那些地方的问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the problem with these joints now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.96,0:46:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吃蛋白质饼的家伙来说 那简直是个健康俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Health clubs for waffle-eatin' pussies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.53,0:46:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们该想想 其它的地方玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should think about uppin' our game here a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.36,0:46:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它更可怕的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about someplace truly diabolical.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.83,0:46:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底在想什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is he thinkin' now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.68,0:46:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在想一个三重戒备的监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's thinkin' a triple-maxprison.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.22,0:46:23.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有阳光 整个星系只有三个星球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A no-daylight slam. Only three of 'em left in this system...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.86,0:46:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中两个太远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two of 'em outstay range for a shitty little under cutter
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.37,0:46:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐这条垃圾船永远也到不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like this one with no legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.45,0:46:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leavin' just... one...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.16,0:46:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烈焰星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crematoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.42,0:46:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那正是你想的 是吗 托姆斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what you had in mind, right, Toombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.76,0:46:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 他怎么知道我们要去的地方 而我们不知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how does he know where we're goin', and we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.57,0:46:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他猜出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dope it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.66,0:46:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我恨这次飞行  - 照做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hate this run.  - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.90,0:46:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道你的这些新船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know about this new crew of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.49,0:46:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好像有点容易激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem a bit skittish.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.42,0:46:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许不应该告诉他们 你以前的船员怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably shouldn't tell 'em what happened to the last crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.32,0:47:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 也许你曾经是最好的杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you supposed to be some slick-shit killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.31,0:47:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但瞧你现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.86,0:47:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all back-of-the-bus and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.74,0:47:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说我们下一个攻击希里奥二号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we attack Helion Two next.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.16,0:47:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接进攻他们的门户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it straight into their teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.06,0:47:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要二万人 五艘战舰 不会再多了 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll cost you 20,000 heads, five warrior ships. Nothing more, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我喜欢强力攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I do prize brute force,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.14,0:48:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也许这种方法更巧妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this approach is perhaps more artful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.14,0:48:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从后面开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.22,0:48:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接进攻希里奥五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go straight to Helion Five,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.26,0:48:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星系的最后一颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last planet in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.42,0:48:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从暗面靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We approach from the night side.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.25,0:48:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先解决大炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove these cannon first,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.62,0:48:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后迅速攻击大型工事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then attack the larger placements at speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.62,0:48:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从后翼打败他们 十天…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll catch them on their rearflank. And in ten days'time,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他行星上的人就会投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest of those worlds will tumble before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.46,0:48:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 和大多情况一样 盲点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, as with most, their blind spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.92,0:48:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在他们身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is right behind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.17,0:48:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在星际附近发现离子飞行的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've located an ion trail which leads off-world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.90,0:48:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你应该到星际 瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you should be off-world, Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.42,0:48:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经派了最好的追踪小组去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've deployed a tracker team. One of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.12,0:48:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管瑞迪在哪 找到他 干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever Riddick has gone, you lens him out and cleanse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.06,0:48:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  你要我坐战舰去追一个种畜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. You want me to take a frigate for one breeder?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.92,0:48:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要提问 瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't question it, Vaako!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.52,0:48:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接受命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it on faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.59,0:49:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马歇尔王对你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's always been unsettled around you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.00,0:49:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直不放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Lord Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.89,0:49:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反复无常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unsteady.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.98,0:49:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他知道他的一半 是像你这样武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps because he knows he's half the warrior you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.02,0:49:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说他过于优雅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some say he's too artistic for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.30,0:49:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一点都不惊讶…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be surprised if someone promoted him soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.24,0:49:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有人加快他的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to full dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.64,0:49:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.81,0:49:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是应该说得轻一点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I say it softly?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.24,0:49:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来更像阴谋？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it sounds more like conspiracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.30,0:49:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 为什么一说到谁能继承王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, why is it that when anyone breathes about the demise of him on the throne...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.29,0:49:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就以为是在阴谋造反？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone assumes a conspiracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.77,0:49:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这不是个明智的方案？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't that just prudent planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.37,0:49:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他死前会任命一个继承者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he is ready, he will name a successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.00,0:49:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.78,0:49:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔？斯卡尔斯？净化者？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toal? Scales? The Purifier?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.73,0:49:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们中没有一个有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.49,0:50:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的力量与威严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the strength, the dignity,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.96,0:50:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦寇王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Lord Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.61,0:50:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以拥有你的战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can keep what you kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.02,0:50:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 住嘴  - 这就是死亡使者的法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop.  - That is the Necromancer way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.45,0:50:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说… 住嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said... stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.81,0:50:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的死亡会在适当的时候到来 不会提前一秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His death will come in due time and not a moment sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.81,0:50:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 因为我为他服务 我们都为他服务 这叫做忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why?  - Because I serve him. We all serve him. It's called fidelity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.21,0:50:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.77,0:50:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 终于引起你的注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, finally some attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.72,0:50:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如此伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have such greatness in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.01,0:50:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你能像我一样看到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only you could see it like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.44,0:50:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.52,0:51:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我从背后悄无声息接近他 他还是发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today I came up behind him in perfect silence and he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.70,0:51:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想进入坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna go down in Necropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.70,0:51:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他半死的灵魂感觉到了我 他知道一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His half-dead soul sensed I was behind him. He sees everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.24,0:51:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When no one is looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.58,0:51:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人在周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when no one's around...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.56,0:51:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坐在王位上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get down on my knees...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.65,0:51:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跪在你的脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you sit on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真没想到  - 元素族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How unexpected.  - An Elemental.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.53,0:51:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在这里  - 我们的一个俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here.  - One of the captives.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.00,0:52:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 三十年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why, after 30 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should it be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.94,0:52:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 他并没有把她当做俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't regard her as a captive, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.69,0:52:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元素族人 口头上说中立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elementals... they talk of neutrality,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.28,0:52:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上都是巫师和间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they're all witches and spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.06,0:52:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外他们为什么都来去如风呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else would they come and go like the wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.35,0:52:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？那个复仇星人现在躲在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where has he gone? Where is the Furyan hiding now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个好武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be the good warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.30,0:52:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go after this Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.26,0:52:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来查出为什么马歇尔王这么怕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find out why the Lord Marshal is so threatened by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.13,0:53:30.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你睡觉磨牙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know you grind your teeth at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.10,0:53:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.15,0:53:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(火成星系 烈焰星)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.10,0:53:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.92,0:53:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开手动控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlocking manual controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.00,0:53:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳面700度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I make 700 degrees on the day side,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.74,0:53:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阴面零下300度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 below on the night side.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.02,0:54:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别被阳光晒到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not get caught in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.86,0:54:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我同时拥有这个地方和地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I owned this place and hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.42,0:54:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把这里出租出去 住在地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rent this place out and live in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.14,0:54:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蓝角… 很好  - 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blue angle... good.  - Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.21,0:54:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.04,0:54:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,角度正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plotted course good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.44,0:54:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.14,0:54:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,降落角度 偏离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angle of approach, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.88,0:54:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 不用手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Ma. No hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.06,0:55:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,减速器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Party poppers!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.34,0:55:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I shit myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.68,0:55:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊慌 托姆斯 太惊慌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skittish, Toombs. Very skittish.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.04,0:56:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comfy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.64,0:56:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅途结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the ride's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.46,0:56:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的墨镜就是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your goggles are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.49,0:57:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四人分帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four-way split!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.86,0:57:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,29 4公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}29.4 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.22,0:57:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.41,0:58:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈说什么 七十万？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the bowels of Christ are you talkin' about, 700K?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.41,0:58:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头 不要接这个活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take this one, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.84,0:58:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 安纳托里已经感觉这是个麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Anatoli here has a nose for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.36,0:58:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这个家伙 瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this one, this Riddick guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.65,0:58:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个大 很大的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big, big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.05,0:58:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 七十万不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, 700,000 is good money.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.69,0:58:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托姆斯 是我就拿这笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd take the money, Toombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.85,0:58:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,组织每年为每个囚犯付我们看守费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guild pays us a caretaker's fee for each prisoner each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.45,0:58:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们付给赏金猎人 其预计寿命总费的20％\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pay mercs 20% of that total fee based on a certain life expectancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.61,0:58:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把藏在控制台后的保险箱打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You open that safe you got hidden behind the console there,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看账本 我来算该拿多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}show me the real books, then we figure out my cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.78,0:58:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后走人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.12,0:58:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的账本 这就是你的建议？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open my books. This is what you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.49,0:58:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.41,0:59:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你相信那些传言 最近可是很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are dangerous days, if you believe the talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.85,0:59:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传言？关于死亡星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk? About dead planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.38,0:59:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于幽灵军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About some ghost army.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.82,0:59:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.74,0:59:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"他们"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.13,0:59:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要再点一下数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll run the numbers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.02,0:59:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许要几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes a couple of days, probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.54,0:59:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以留下来作客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can stay as my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.25,1:00:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少在这 我们是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least here, we are all safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.81,1:00:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的 头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes?  - Yes, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.84,1:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give it a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.56,1:00:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.42,1:00:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有囚犯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are inmates...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there are convicts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.20,1:00:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个罪犯都有一个编号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A convict has a certain code.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.13,1:01:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要学会尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he knows to show a certain respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.85,1:01:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯则相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An inmate, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.56,1:01:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看守别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pulls the pin on his fellow man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.34,1:01:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,担当守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the guards' work for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.08,1:01:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给这场游戏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brings shame...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.73,1:01:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.96,1:01:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你想做哪个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, which are you gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.57,1:01:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.18,1:01:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是路过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just passin' through.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.51,1:01:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到烈焰星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Crematoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.57,1:01:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该从这个最佳位置捅进去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I go for the sweet spot?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.14,1:01:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脊椎左边 第四节腰椎下面 腹部大动脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left of the spine, fourth lumbar down, the abdominal aorta.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.82,1:01:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血如泉涌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a gusher.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.85,1:01:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎样才能有你这样的眼睛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I get eyes like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.57,1:01:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得杀一些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta kill a few people.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.09,1:02:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.38,1:02:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀过很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did a lot of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.09,1:02:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你应该被关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you gotta get sent to a slam.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.06,1:02:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个永远见不到阳光的地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One where they tell you you'll never see daylight again?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.93,1:02:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有医生能擦亮我的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only there wasn't any doctor here who could shine my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.88,1:02:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使有二十条库司烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even for 20 menthol Kools.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.26,1:02:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过的话有真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there anything you said that was true?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.24,1:02:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么样？杀了我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do, huh? Go for the sweet spot?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.66,1:02:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你在和谁说话 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember who you're talkin' to, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.50,1:02:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克已经死了 她是弱者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack's dead. She was weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.10,1:02:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不能坚持下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She couldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.88,1:02:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在叫凯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Kyra now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.40,1:02:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是只野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm a new animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.29,1:03:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可以是次很好的试验 可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can be quite a test, these deep runs...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.86,1:03:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探测我们的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tests of our inner selves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.24,1:03:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you find that true?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.70,1:03:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some men do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离舰队还有段距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just being so far from the armada,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.84,1:03:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思想开始充满奇怪的想法 怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the mind can start to fill with strange thoughts, doubts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:03:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你从未怀疑过吗 瓦寇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you ever have doubts, Vaako?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.13,1:04:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怀疑？- 关于这场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doubts?  - About the campaign.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.46,1:04:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于马歇尔王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About Lord Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.57,1:04:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先并且一直 我是一个死亡使者的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First and always, I am a Necromonger commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.94,1:04:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 如果你是在考验我的忠诚 那么你只是考验了我的耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you're here to test my loyalty, you succeed only in testing my patience.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.25,1:04:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 不 不 那并不是我在这里的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No, that's not why I'm here at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.40,1:04:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴能占用你一会时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad I could steal you away for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.52,1:04:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没让你感到奇怪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't it strike you odd?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.09,1:04:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的马歇尔王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we have the current Lord Marshal...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.92,1:04:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在摧毁整个社会 但他却不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}destroying entire societies, and yet he can't bring himself...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.82,1:04:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀掉一个不能反抗的元素族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to kill one stranded Elemental.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.70,1:05:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.54,1:05:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不信仰我们的神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't pray to our god.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.28,1:05:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不相信神 我听说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pray to no god, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.22,1:05:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元素族人 我们预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elementals... we calculate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.89,1:05:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't we all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.44,1:05:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在 让我们首先开始做第一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now let's have first things first.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.33,1:05:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞迪怎么了？- 说真的 我不知道他去了哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What of Riddick?  - In truth, I don't know where he went.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.76,1:05:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我更关心他从哪来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In truth, I'm more interested in where he came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.13,1:05:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心你的脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.94,1:05:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都很好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wondered,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.48,1:05:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元素族人能飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does an air Elemental fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.62,1:05:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.42,1:05:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预测一下你活着离开这个星球的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calculate the odds of you getting off this planet alive...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.34,1:05:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在把它们切成两半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now cut them in half.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.82,1:05:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们飞不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.12,1:05:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们擅长滑行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we glide very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.25,1:05:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别威胁我 死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your threats, Necromonger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.26,1:05:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉你想知道的瑞迪的情况的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have told you about Riddick for the asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.96,1:05:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它关系到一个预言 一个30多年以前的预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It concerns a foretelling, a prediction now more than 30 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.33,1:06:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位年轻的勇士曾经问过一个预言家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young warrior once consulteda seer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.12,1:06:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预言家告诉他说一个出生在复仇星上的孩子 一个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was told a child would be born on the planet Furya... a male child...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.22,1:06:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天会打倒这个武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would someday cause the warrior's downfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他在黑暗中死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause his untimed death.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.32,1:06:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇星？复仇星是个被毁灭了的世界 没有生命存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furya? Furya's a ruined world. No life to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.60,1:06:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个好的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For good reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.30,1:06:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个年轻的武士进攻了复仇星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This young warrior mounted an attack on Furya,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.05,1:06:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀掉他发现的所有年轻的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killing all young males he could find,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.58,1:06:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至用脐带扼死那些孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even strangling some with their birth cords.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.02,1:06:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次彻底的打击 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An artful stroke, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.05,1:06:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个努力打破预言的武士 就是后来成为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this warrior, the one who tried to outwit the prediction, would later become...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.62,1:06:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他为什么担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.64,1:06:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马歇尔王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.81,1:06:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个会让这个男人… 的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which would make the man-child...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.00,1:06:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他担心没有把男孩杀死在摇篮里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He worries he missed killing that child in its crib.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.86,1:06:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.54,1:07:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这就是对他如此重要的原因  - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's why it's so vital to him.  - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.21,1:07:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是关于一个预言  - 等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about a prophecy.  - Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.29,1:07:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.80,1:07:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去实现马歇尔王的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what your lord asks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.26,1:07:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要为他除掉瑞迪 这样做…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cleanse Riddick for him, and in doing so...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.90,1:07:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以证明你不朽的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you prove your undying loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.37,1:07:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许最后他会放松警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And perhaps then he'll finally let down his guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.09,1:08:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still here, I See?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.16,1:08:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这已经18年了 看这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been here 18 years. See this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.28,1:08:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得她是如此的漂亮 嗯 在灯光下会更动人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember how gorgeous she was. Well, gorgeous in a certain light.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.09,1:08:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 受到死亡诅咒的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, for the goddamn death of me,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.08,1:08:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记不起她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot remember her name.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.10,1:08:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂食时间到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeding time!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.06,1:08:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里度过我们的炼狱生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here for the rest of our unnatural lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.41,1:09:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.89,1:09:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论你做什么 别看它们的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't make eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.37,1:10:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.12,1:11:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是动物语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an animal thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.99,1:11:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜她身 她总是在身上藏着刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check here for me. She's always got a blade somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.57,1:12:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.24,1:12:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她不喜欢别人碰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think she likes being touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.57,1:13:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你们能走的时候快走 否则准备受伤吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd take my wounded and go while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.25,1:13:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这个地方有名字吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a name for this private little world of yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.24,1:13:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们不跑会发生什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens there when we don't just run away?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.31,1:13:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用一只汤杯杀掉我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll kill us... with a soup cup?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.85,1:13:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上 是茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.18,1:13:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.86,1:13:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会用茶杯杀死你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you with my teacup.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.00,1:13:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道规则 如果仍在名单上 就没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the rule. They aren't dead if they're still on the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.48,1:13:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.37,1:14:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.38,1:14:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用茶杯杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death by teacup.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.76,1:14:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 为什么我没想到？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.52,1:14:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是来玩"谁是最好的杀手？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't come to play "Who's the Better Killer?"
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是我喜欢的游戏 你没听说吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's my favorite game. Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.53,1:14:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我听说你来找我  - 就这些？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I heard you came lookin' for me.  - Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.22,1:14:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错过了精彩的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you missed the good part.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.77,1:14:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被一些从天狼五号星来的 赏金猎人给盯上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hooked up with some mercs outta Lupus Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.06,1:15:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我带走 教我交易 给了我一把好刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said they'd take me on, teach me the trade, give me a good cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.02,1:15:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我从奴隶中解救出来 瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They slaved me out, Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.08,1:15:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道在那个年纪里对于 你来说意味着什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what that could do to you when you're that age?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.36,1:15:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当你12岁的时候？- 我告诉你留在新麦加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When you're 12 years old?  - I told you to stay in New Mecca.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.36,1:15:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没听到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you not listen?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.12,1:15:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赏金猎人都盯着我的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had mercs on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.06,1:15:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也一直会盯着我的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always have mercs on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.65,1:15:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在一个冰冻星球呆了5年 只是为了让他们远离你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent five years on a frozen heap just to keep 'em away from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.40,1:15:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你却离开那里加入了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you go and sign up with the same fake badges...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.30,1:15:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会杀了你 并用你来做诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that wanted to cut you up and use you for bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.56,1:15:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指什么 瑞迪？你干的就是对的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you pitching, Riddick? That you cutting' out was a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.77,1:15:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在我的掩护下穿过宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you had my ass covered from halfway across the universe?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.41,1:15:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和赏金猎人签约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You signed with mercs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.75,1:15:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我身边没有任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was nobody else around.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.72,1:16:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开盖子 呼吸点新鲜空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's pop the cork. Get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.69,1:16:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们去了顶层…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they do go topside...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.24,1:16:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去换空气去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to swap out air.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.02,1:16:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.66,1:16:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.64,1:16:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦它发生了 它会发生的很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it happens, it'll happen fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.20,1:16:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我切断栅栏的时候 呆在我后面或者呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on my leg when I cut fence or stay here...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.18,1:17:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,度过你平凡的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the rest of your natural life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.21,1:17:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能离开这里 没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody outs this place. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.29,1:17:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't "nobody."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.50,1:17:30.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是好消息 让我和这里的朋友讨论一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news first. Talked things over with my amigos here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.97,1:17:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们杀掉你们将可以得到七十七万五千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll cut you in for 775K.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.73,1:17:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.52,1:17:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏消息是什么？他们关掉了这里的妓院？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the bad news? They close the local whorehouse?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.91,1:17:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 比那要坏 坏的多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The bad news is worse than that. Much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.94,1:17:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的驾驶员看到了这个 它越过了这条航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our pilot, he saw this. It crossed a shipping lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.12,1:17:59.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道这个是什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea what this might be?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.52,1:18:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没看过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never saw nothing' like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这艘飞船是回希里奥 帕莱姆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship charts back to Helion Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.92,1:18:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道 安纳托里有一个能发现麻烦的鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Anatoli's got a nose for trouble,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.80,1:18:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他认为麻烦会跟着你们到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he thinks trouble follows you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.82,1:18:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们清除了我们的踪迹 到这个鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. We dusted our tracks and got the hell outta there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.45,1:18:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能我们没有甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way we didn't lose them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.12,1:18:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Them"?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.49,1:18:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的囚犯 我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my prisoner. Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.44,1:18:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是别人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody else's.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.09,1:18:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我要我的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want my money now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.01,1:18:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.09,1:18:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你偷走了一个囚犯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you stole a prisoner...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.00,1:18:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从他们那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from "them"?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.22,1:20:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.08,1:20:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.08,1:20:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该带走这些钱的 托姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should taken the money, Toombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.96,1:21:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要杀我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.48,1:21:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赏金猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mercs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.62,1:21:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿有一些警卫 但不可能是所有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some guards here, but this can't be all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.52,1:21:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到后面去检查一下他们的船舱 要小心些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check their slots in the back... and be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.13,1:21:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.79,1:21:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫们不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guards ain't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.45,1:22:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发现死亡使者来这里找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They figured out the Necros are coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.22,1:22:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们计划拿走所有的钱 干掉赏金猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan was to clean the bank, ghost the mercs,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}break wide through the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.89,1:22:11.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后有人拿这个火箭发射器 在这里开了一炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then somebody got a lucky shot off with this rocket launcher here...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.02,1:22:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后拿走了这个橇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took out the sled.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.24,1:22:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫们步行离开 但是破坏了门锁 因此没人能够跟上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guards took off on foot but rigged the door so no one could follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.00,1:22:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要从机棚里弄一架飞船 留下这里的其他人等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll take the one ship in the hangar and leave everyone else here to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.16,1:22:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you know all this shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.84,1:22:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时并不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't even here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这本来就是我的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it was my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.14,1:22:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真该带走这些钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should taken the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.65,1:22:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.28,1:23:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么？他在想什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? What is he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.62,1:23:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一旦太阳出来  - 我们只能坚持5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Once that sun comes up...  - We'll last five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.77,1:23:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5分钟 我们在外面不可能坚持过30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes. We ain't gonna last 30 seconds out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.77,1:23:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会把我们像火柴一样点燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll light you up like a match.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.45,1:23:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20英里的缓冲区域 30公里到机棚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20-mile buffer zone and 30 klicks to the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.06,1:23:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那样的地形上走30公里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30 klicks over that terrain?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.57,1:23:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它正在朝正确的方向移动 我们能做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's moving in the right direction. We could make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.76,1:23:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲在阴暗处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay behind the night,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.26,1:23:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在太阳出来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ahead of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.44,1:23:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要达到一定的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gonna be one speed...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.68,1:23:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.77,1:23:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不能跟上 就别靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't keep up, don't step up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.89,1:24:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll just die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.82,1:25:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.42,1:25:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.53,1:25:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.82,1:25:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 上去 快上去 从这爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go! Go on! Go! Climb here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.01,1:25:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快爬 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.70,1:25:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.50,1:26:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.66,1:26:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过来看看  - 因为安纳托里这样说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take a look.  - Because Anatoli says so?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.72,1:26:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的鼻子这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because his nose says so.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.19,1:26:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing' up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.81,1:26:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.36,1:26:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.60,1:26:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正向火山区域前进 他们打算弄走我们的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're heading right for the volcano fields. They're going for our ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.34,1:26:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不可能先到机棚 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No chance do they get to the hangar first. No chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.24,1:27:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个 下一个洞口 我们要在那里抓住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next one! Next hole! We'll catch 'em there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.13,1:27:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再让你们跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more run for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.61,1:27:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did the big guy go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.48,1:27:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.37,1:28:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关上它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.01,1:28:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是干什么？你不关心你的死活吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that? You don't care if you live or die?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.73,1:28:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我先杀了他们 就无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I kill them first, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.44,1:28:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.56,1:28:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.18,1:29:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyra?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.46,1:30:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯拉  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kyra!  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.28,1:30:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that ass moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.89,1:30:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.13,1:30:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我说过不在乎死活吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what I said about not caring if I lived or died?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.93,1:30:59.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是开玩笑的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew I was kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.34,1:31:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"One speed."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.21,1:31:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温度异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temperature differential.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.85,1:31:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.86,1:31:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太晚了 我们从来都没有想过会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. We're never gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.30,1:31:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的绳子 给我你的绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your rope! Gimme your rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.49,1:31:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的水 所有的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your water. All of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.88,1:31:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲在山的阴暗处 别等我 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in the shadow of the mountain. Don't wait for me. Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.38,1:31:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.58,1:32:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.13,1:32:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的机棚在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is that hangar?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.18,1:32:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.15,1:32:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.45,1:33:25.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Necros.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.18,1:33:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a whole lotta Necro firepower.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.46,1:33:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 真恨自己不是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! I hate not being the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.90,1:34:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在太阳重新追上我们烧掉整个山谷之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure we got three minutes
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.58,1:34:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有3分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the sun hits us again, burns out this whole valley.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.69,1:34:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 我们干还是不干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait.  - We gonna do this or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.42,1:34:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.84,1:34:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.70,1:34:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的名字叫艾伦 我从来不曾真的忘记她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name was Ellen. I never really forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.19,1:34:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah! Boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.44,1:34:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记得你喜欢的游戏吗？- "谁是最好的杀手"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember that favorite game of yours?  - "Who's the Better Killer?"
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.45,1:35:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们开始吧  - 上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's play.  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.46,1:35:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the right!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.09,1:35:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.58,1:35:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyra!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.66,1:36:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞跋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybar!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.26,1:37:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.46,1:37:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.18,1:38:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.65,1:38:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.34,1:38:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.29,1:38:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以求饶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can kneel.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.28,1:39:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你现在知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.53,1:39:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你知道谁毁灭了复仇星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know who tore Furya apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.25,1:39:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个印记充满了整个民族的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mark carries the anger of an entire race.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.50,1:39:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这会带来痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's going to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.68,1:41:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyra?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.41,1:41:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该告诉你一个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was supposed to deliver a message to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.32,1:41:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果瓦寇不能杀掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if Vaako failed to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.52,1:41:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个来自马歇尔王的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A message from the Lord Marshal himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.19,1:42:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你离开希里奥 离开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tells you to stay away from Helion, stay away from him,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.03,1:42:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为报酬 你不会再被追杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in return, you'll be hunted no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.21,1:42:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是瓦寇很可能会说你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Vaako will most likely report you as dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.38,1:42:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这就是你的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.57,1:42:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去做别人从未成功过的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chance to do what no man has ever done.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.70,1:42:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.55,1:42:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要把她带去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will they take her?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.56,1:42:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些事情 我们都开始了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all began... as something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.00,1:42:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经做了… 不可思议的事情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done... unbelievable things...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.61,1:43:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以信仰起誓 那从来都不是我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the name of a faith that was never my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.37,1:43:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会像对待我这样去对待她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he'll do to her what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.54,1:43:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为死亡使者我警告你别回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Necromonger in me warns you not to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.45,1:43:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为复仇星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Furyan in me...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.95,1:43:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不要听这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hopes you won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.56,1:43:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神知道… 我曾经梦见过它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God knows... I've dreamed of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.36,1:44:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(希里奥 帕莱姆星)
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.21,1:44:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我失去了一个净化者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lost a Purifier...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.49,1:44:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在众多的指挥官中又得到了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I have gained a first among commanders.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.21,1:44:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点迟了 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is overdue, isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.06,1:44:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都知道你的功勋卓著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we acknowledge your many accomplishments,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.64,1:44:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坚定不移的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your steady faith,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.85,1:45:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的是你永远的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and above all, your unflinching loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.34,1:45:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对服从 忠诚直到暗黑星际来临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obedience without question. Loyalty till UnderVerse come.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.22,1:45:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.08,1:45:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是其中的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a day of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.72,1:45:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高兴起来 瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look more pleased, Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.04,1:45:48.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经消灭了他的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have killed his enemy...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.72,1:45:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他的疑心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.25,1:45:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该把他的头带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have brought back his head.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.98,1:45:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见他没有了呼吸 你看见他死在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw him unbreathing. You saw him dead on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.26,1:45:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞迪不是普通的人 一眨眼的时间就杀死了我20个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddick was no common breeder. In a heartbeat he dropped 20 of my men.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.24,1:46:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的神话都不是奇迹 甚至不存在宗教里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All mysteries are not miracles, not even in this religion.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.81,1:46:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你说它存在 那么它就存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you say it is certain, then it is certain,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.28,1:46:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经准备那样说了 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we've already said it, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.34,1:46:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.25,1:46:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 告诉我这是否是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell me if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.82,1:46:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我那个复仇星人已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me the Furyan is gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.17,1:46:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我就可以结束这场战争 不再听到他的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I can close this campaign without hearing his boot steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.70,1:46:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he is dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.76,1:46:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉我离他那样的命运也不远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense I'm not far from the same fate,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.06,1:46:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你已经没有用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being of no further use here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.81,1:46:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该告诉你瑞迪还活着吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't I tell you that Riddick is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.72,1:46:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激我 艾尔伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try me, Aereon.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.70,1:46:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以让你和其他希里奥 帕莱姆人一起去做苦力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could plow you under with the rest of Helion Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.42,1:46:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人真正知道将来会怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one really knows the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.22,1:46:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么告诉我瓦寇成功的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then tell me the odds that Vaako met with success,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.77,1:46:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会成为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I will now be the one...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.33,1:46:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带领人民进入暗黑星际的王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can carry his people across the threshold into UnderVerse,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.65,1:46:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里他们开始真正的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where they shall begin true life.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.29,1:47:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我我想听的 艾尔伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what I want to hear, Aereon,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.26,1:47:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我会挽救你的家园… 最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe I'll save your home world... for last.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.14,1:47:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有这个可能性  - 哪个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The odds are good...  - That?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.93,1:47:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将到达暗黑星际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you will reach the UnderVerse...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.09,1:47:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.85,1:48:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ascension protocol!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.49,1:48:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们仍然有很多人在外面 马歇尔王 地面部队 侦察飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have numbers out there, Lord Marshal... sweep teams, recon ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.48,1:48:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有时间赶回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would be hard-pressed to make it back...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.18,1:48:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我的舰队离开地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my armada off the ground!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.82,1:49:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说在希里奥  - 我是说在这里 这艘飞船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean on Helion?  - I mean here, on this very ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.29,1:49:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是看错了？因为害怕而眼花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you be wrong? Mind fabricates fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.57,1:49:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是不是看错了？- 没你错的厉害 你还让他活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could you be wrong?  - Not so wrong as you when you left him alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.76,1:49:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同样的错误你犯了两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's twice a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.58,1:49:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不仅仅是失败 而且是继位失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only your failure, but now the report of success.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.25,1:49:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么弥补这个过错？该怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we salvage this? How? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.97,1:49:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该让马歇尔王知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Marshal's got to be warned.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.85,1:49:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你将永远看不到暗黑星际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never see the UnderVerse!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.72,1:49:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会很快杀了我们两个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will kill us both before our due time.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.16,1:49:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为应该给瑞迪一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say give Riddick his chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.77,1:49:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他真如你所说的那么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he is half of what you think,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.44,1:50:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他至少能够让马歇尔王受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can at least wound the Lord Marshal...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.52,1:50:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我们必须行动的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that is when you must act.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.21,1:50:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅是取代他？仅仅是杀了他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to take his place? Just to keep what I kill?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.70,1:50:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是死亡使者的命运  - 这还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is the Necromonger way.  - It is not enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.45,1:50:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么为了你的信仰去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you do it for the faith!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.93,1:50:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他害怕了 他就变弱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he has fear, he has weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.09,1:50:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他变弱了 瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he has weakness, Vaako...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.69,1:50:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就不应该继续统治下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is unworthy of lordship.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.10,1:50:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做是为了所有的死亡使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do it for all Necromongers.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.04,1:50:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚守信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect the faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.30,1:50:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这仍然可以是历史的一页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can still be a day of days,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.44,1:50:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the timing...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.25,1:50:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须恰到好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must be flawless.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.40,1:51:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终形态 执行我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final protocol. Execute on my order.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.38,1:51:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.00,1:51:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们现在离开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they leaving now?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.40,1:51:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西扎 进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ziza! Go inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.06,1:52:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现这个影像兵死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found this Lensor dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.84,1:52:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看他最后的影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me his last sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.45,1:52:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Toal.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.14,1:53:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会逃走两次的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't escape twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.65,1:54:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.32,1:54:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是来找我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.97,1:55:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider this:
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.76,1:55:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你现在在这里倒下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you fall here now,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.48,1:55:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都站不起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll never rise.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.13,1:55:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果你选择另外一种方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you choose another way...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.57,1:55:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡使者的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Necromonger way...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.26,1:55:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会在某时死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll die in due time...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.90,1:55:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在暗黑星际里重新复活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and rise again in the UnderVerse.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.97,1:56:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.22,1:56:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会感到痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.56,1:56:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at first.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.16,1:56:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是一会过后 痛苦会消失 就像他们说的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But after a while, the pain goes away, just as they promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.76,1:56:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和我在一起吗 凯拉？- 有一瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you with me, Kyra?  - There's a moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.52,1:56:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你几乎能从他的眼里看到暗黑星际的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you can almost see the UnderVerse through his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.53,1:56:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它看上去是那么的完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes it sound perfect...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.34,1:56:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个每个人都能够重新开始的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a place where anyone can start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.10,1:56:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我在一起吗 凯拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with me, Kyra?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.40,1:56:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在转化…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Convert now...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.65,1:56:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是永远的倒下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or fall forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.68,1:57:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀掉了我所有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.33,1:57:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vaako.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.96,1:57:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.29,1:57:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经很长时间没看到自己流血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been a long time since I've seen my own blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.53,1:58:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他最后的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are his last moments.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.95,1:59:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.85,1:59:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.58,2:00:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀不了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the one to bring me down.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.01,2:00:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 在他受伤的时候杀了那头野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! Kill the beast while he's wounded!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.94,2:01:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我 瓦寇 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, Vaako. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.13,2:01:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦寇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vaako?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.12,2:01:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.28,2:01:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰到好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flawless.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.48,2:01:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.24,2:02:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No-o-o!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.37,2:02:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在会怎样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what would be the odds of that?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.70,2:02:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.46,2:02:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我在一起吗 凯拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with me, Kyra?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.58,2:02:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was always with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.06,2:02:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.34,2:04:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是收获的战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep what you kill.
